[00:09.40]Is there anyone who doesn’t know about those great friends Harry, Hermione and Ron in the Harry Potter books?
[00:19.78]JK Rowling’s stories are world famous and part of their success is because of the friendship between those three main characters.
[00:30.18]But there are many examples of great friends in literature.
[00:35.62]Let’s look at some more.
[00:39.06]In 1844 French writer Alexandre Dumas wrote The Three Musketeers.
[00:47.96]The story is about a young man called D’Artagnan who goes to Paris to join the Musketeers, special soldiers who protect the king.
[01:00.86]He meets Athos, Aramis and Porthos, three friends who are the greatest Musketeers in France, and they have many adventures together.
[01:13.84]They often say ‘one for all and all for one’, which shows their strong friendship.
[01:23.10]The Jungle Book, 1894 by Rudyard Kipling is a story about animals who are very like people.
[01:34.10]Some good, some not so good.
[01:37.82]But there is also Mowgli, a small human boy who grows up in the Indian jungle.
[01:45.42]Many animals want to find him because he knows how to make fire.
[01:53.22]Mowgli’s great friend and guardian is a bear called Baloo and also a black panther called Bagheera, who help him to escape from the tiger, Shere Khan.
[02:09.76]The Lord of the Rings, 1937 to 1949 by JRR Tolkien is a fantasy story about Frodo who gets a ring from his uncle Bilbo Baggins.
[02:26.68]Frodo lives in a place called the Shire in Middle Earth and has a friend, Sam.
[02:35.14]When Frodo leaves the Shire on a long journey with the ring, Sam as well as some other friends goes with him.
[02:46.34]Sam’s friendship is very important for Frodo as he faces many dangerous situations; Sam is always there to help him.
[02:58.14]A more modern book is My Brilliant Friend, 2011 by Elena Ferrante.
[03:08.14]It is the first of a series of four novels.
[03:13.17]The story begins in Naples in the 1950s.
[03:18.30]Elena and Lila are friends at school but they have a lot of arguments, too.
[03:24.44]As they grow up life takes them away from each other, but when they are both old things happen that bring them together again.
